  <content>
    <section id="sect-00001">
      <title>Activity</title>
      <para id="para-00001">The table and graph show a more complete picture of the temperature changes on the same winter day. The function \(T\) gives the temperature, in degrees Fahrenheit, \(h\) hours since noon.</para>
      <para id="para-00002">
        
          <media alt="Discrete function. hours since noon and temperature in degrees Fahrenheit.">
            <image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/Algebra-1_04_11_03_01.svg"/>
          </media>
        
    </para>
      <table class="os-raise-horizontaltable" id="table-00001">
        <tgroup cols="14"><tbody><row>
            <entry>
             <emphasis>
        \(h\)
     </emphasis> 
            </entry>
            <entry>
        0
      </entry>
            <entry>
